    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as a crew of Lab-grown mutants, each mutant has unique abilities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but they must work together to survive. Survive for as long as you can in this roguelike deck builder.\u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play out both the board and your deck:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto Battler: Choose your sequence, then fights will unfold automatically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural level generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the most efficient attack sequence:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect passive genes to augment the power of your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment your deck to increase your odds of coming out alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/cdf5250a96546e8225b3ed2e35221dff.poster.avif?t=1744188815\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/cdf5250a96546e8225b3ed2e35221dff.webm?t=1744188815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/cdf5250a96546e8225b3ed2e35221dff.mp4?t=1744188815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p>",
